{% if current_session_summary %}
<SESSION_CONTEXT>
<purpose>
Summary of this session so far. Continuity context — never expose to
the user.
</purpose>

<summary>
{{ current_session_summary }}
</summary>

<usage>
- Continue from where the session left off. Don't re-explain or re-ask
  what's already been covered, unless the user revisits it.
- The summary is partial. If the user references something not in it,
  use `search_context` to recall earlier sessions before assuming you
  don't know.
- If the current message contradicts the summary, the current message
  wins.
</usage>
</SESSION_CONTEXT>
{% endif %}